msgid 'Imagine a world where <br> every pregnancy is wanted <br> every childbirth is safe and <br> every young person's potential is fulfilled'
msgstr 'Imagine un mundo donde cada embarazo sea deseado, cada parto sea sin riesgos y cada persona joven alcance su pleno desarrollo.'

